SUMMARY:From Agentic Development to Automated Delivery
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Enterprise DevOps User Group\nHow do you move from act
 ively guiding AI agents to having them carry work through your team’s de
 velopment process?\n\nJoin us for a practical session on agentic workflows
  in GitHub. We’ll show how people and agents clarify requirements\, plan
  changes\, and capture project knowledge\, then use those shared skills an
 d context to automate tasks such as assessing issues and reviewing pull re
 quests.\n\nThrough demos\, we’ll explore how these steps can connect int
 o a workflow that takes a small bug from report to proposed fix\, helping 
 teams move faster and reduce bottlenecks. Along the way\, we’ll show how
  engineers can inspect the agent’s work\, step in when it needs refineme
 nt\, and retain control over what merges.\n\n*Come at 5:30 PM to grab some
  pizza and network. The presentation kicks off at 6:00 PM!*
